    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You pursue the truth relentlessly. Perhaps you witnessed something wondrous or horrifying and now need to unravel its mystery, or perhaps you are driven by a sense of universal justice and honesty. Whether your cases are local crimes or eldritch conspiracies, you are determined to expose what others want to keep hidden.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Intelligence, Wisdom, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.lO7HarazO4CpPrCN]{Sharp Eye} or a Dark Gift feat of your choice</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Insight and Investigation</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulDisguiseKi]{Disguise Kit}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulDisguiseKi]{Disguise Kit}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagManacles000]{Manacles}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagShovel00000]{Shovel}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 3 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagVial0000000]{Vials}, 16 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
